## Why This Is Asked

Tests diagnosing certificate rotation within a service mesh, focusing on end-to-end TLS verification, per-tenant isolation, and zero-downtime deployment strategies.

## Key Concepts

- TLS certificate rotation propagation across Kubernetes secrets and Envoy proxies
- mTLS handshake troubleshooting in Istio service mesh
- Canary rollouts with automated rollback capabilities
- Per-tenant routing and isolation in multi-tenant mesh environments

## Code Example

```javascript
// TLS handshake tester (pseudo)
async function testTLS(target) {
  try {
    const response = await fetch(target);
    return response.ok;
  } catch {
    return false;
  }
}
```

## Follow-up Questions

- How would you monitor certificate expiration dates across all pods?
- What metrics would you use to detect TLS handshake failures in real-time?
- How do you ensure tenant isolation during certificate rotation?
